     ===================================================== -->
<div class="p7-banner">
    <div class="p7-phase-pill">Phase 7 · Dual-Rail Regenerative Steam Loop</div>
    <h1>Steam-Rail <em>Self-Sustaining</em> Crankless Engine</h1>
    <p>
        Two independent steam rails each power three rotary converter wheels. Each wheel spins a dedicated
        high-output alternator, feeding a shared transformer/rectifier bus. A PCW-managed resistor
        bank regulates re-injection current back to the immersion heater — targeting net-zero battery draw
        at highway cruise. A backup EV motor engages on demand. No pistons. No combustion. Water in, torque out.
    </p>
</div>

